          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            Pseudo-preorders are to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/preorders"} preorders
            as
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pseudo-equivalence+relations"} pseudo-equivalence relations
            are to
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivalence+relations"} equivalence relations
          %p
            Pseudo-prosets are important because they are the basic structure used to build many other structures like
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/categories"} categories
            and
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/setoids"} setoids
